{"articleSourceOrder":20,"packageRef":{"id":"content.python.runoob3","version":"1.0.0"},"rootNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1","nodes":[{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1","parent":"py3-source/ungrouped","orderInGroup":20,"titleOriginal":"Python3 编程第一步","titleDisplay":"Python3 编程第一步","sidebarTitleOriginal":" Python3 编程第一步","order":20,"role":"tutorial","tag":"h1","titlePath":["Python3 编程第一步"],"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-step1.html","sourceSha256":"a9c0927e9fd364ca359d597ee063502dd81c20c59964eff7578a2d7ab5573b65","articleSourceOrder":20,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.chapter.python3-step1","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","leaf":false,"activityId":null,"exampleId":null,"questionId":null,"status":"authored","body":["学会单个语句后，可以用一段小程序把变量、循环和输出连接起来。第一步不是先写很多语法，而是为输入、当前状态和下一步变化分别命名，再用几组小数据验证规则。\n\n下面生成小于20的斐波那契数：从0、1开始，每个后继项是前两项之和。程序用临时变量保存旧值，避免前一次赋值覆盖后一次计算仍需要的信息。\n\n~~~python\nlimit = 20\na = 0\nb = 1\nwhile a < limit:\n    print(a)\n    old_a = a\n    a = b\n    b = old_a + b\n~~~\n\n输出逐行为0、1、1、2、3、5、8、13。两次出现1是序列本身的两项，不是循环重复了同一状态。每轮打印当前a，再把一对状态(a,b)推进为原来的(b,a+b)。\n\n| 进入本轮时a、b | 本轮输出 | 推进后a、b |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 0、1 | 0 | 1、1 |\n| 1、1 | 1 | 1、2 |\n| 1、2 | 1 | 2、3 |\n| 8、13 | 8 | 13、21 |\n| 13、21 | 13 | 21、34 |\n\n下一次a为21，`a < 20`为假，循环结束。若先写`a = b`，再写`b = a + b`，第二句读取的a已经改变，计算将不再遵守原递推式。完整Python也可用`a, b = b, a + b`同时赋值表达同一规则，但临时变量形式更容易逐步观察。\n\n## 改动一个要求，再核对边界\n\n把limit设为1，只输出0；设为0则循环一次都不进入，没有输出。这些结果来自“输出严格小于limit的项”，不是要求输出固定项数。若题目改成前8项，应改用计数控制，不能只把同一个limit换一个数字。\n\n教材的变量更新、逐项循环和while推进共同构成这里的基础。完成算法后，再决定每个数一行还是同一行分隔；输出排版不应反过来改变状态更新。下一小节用print的end参数调整排版，并比较它与算法状态的边界。"]},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~1","parent":"py3-source/python3-step1","order":1,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Python3 编程第一步","实例"],"titleOccurrence":1,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-step1.html","sourceSha256":"a9c0927e9fd364ca359d597ee063502dd81c20c59964eff7578a2d7ab5573b65","articleSourceOrder":20,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.b62fa2837514da91f3aaeaa8","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~2","parent":"py3-source/python3-step1","order":2,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Python3 编程第一步","实例"],"titleOccurrence":2,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-step1.html","sourceSha256":"a9c0927e9fd364ca359d597ee063502dd81c20c59964eff7578a2d7ab5573b65","articleSourceOrder":20,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.d6fd9c3bb1feb654a9739ba3","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~3","parent":"py3-source/python3-step1","order":3,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Python3 编程第一步","实例"],"titleOccurrence":3,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-step1.html","sourceSha256":"a9c0927e9fd364ca359d597ee063502dd81c20c59964eff7578a2d7ab5573b65","articleSourceOrder":20,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.d224360633420d8b2ed2e7c4","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~4","parent":"py3-source/python3-step1","order":4,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Python3 编程第一步","实例"],"titleOccurrence":4,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-step1.html","sourceSha256":"a9c0927e9fd364ca359d597ee063502dd81c20c59964eff7578a2d7ab5573b65","articleSourceOrder":20,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.4533d4764aa4329913