tatus":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~7","parent":"py3-source/python3-step1","order":8,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Python3 编程第一步","实例"],"titleOccurrence":7,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-step1.html","sourceSha256":"a9c0927e9fd364ca359d597ee063502dd81c20c59964eff7578a2d7ab5573b65","articleSourceOrder":20,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.9febfb2fd15ead0370c2c477","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~7/end%20%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AD%97~1","parent":"py3-source/python3-step1#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~7","order":9,"tag":"h3","titleOriginal":"end 关键字","titleDisplay":"end 关键字","titlePath":["Python3 编程第一步","实例","end 关键字"],"titleOccurrence":1,"role":"section","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-step1.html","sourceSha256":"a9c0927e9fd364ca359d597ee063502dd81c20c59964eff7578a2d7ab5573b65","articleSourceOrder":20,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.8bbca663cec248ca6b85110c","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","leaf":true,"activityId":"py3.section.8bbca663cec248ca6b85110c.check","exampleId":"py3.section.8bbca663cec248ca6b85110c.example","questionId":null,"status":"authored","goal":"能用本节规则解答“先 print('A',end='-') 再 print('B')，最终一行是什么？”","body":["标题中的end指print的关键字参数，并不是Python保留关键字。print默认在参数之间写一个空格，最后写一个换行；end指定这次调用结束时追加什么文本，sep则指定同一次调用的多个参数之间放什么。\n\n~~~python\nprint('A', end='-')\nprint('B')\nprint('C', 'D', sep=':', end='!')\nprint('E')\n~~~\n\n完整输出为：\n\n~~~text\nA-B\nC:D!E\n~~~\n\n第一次print不写默认换行，写入A后追加-；第二次写B并按默认规则换行。第三次用冒号隔开C、D，末尾追加感叹号；第四次接着写E，最后再换行。前一次改过end不会永久改变后续print的默认值。\n\n## 让循环输出与循环状态分开\n\n~~~python\nfor value in range(1, 4):\n    print(value, end=' ')\nprint()\nprint('done')\n~~~\n\n第一行显示1、2、3，每个数之后都有一个空格，包括3之后；第二行是done。独立的`print()`没有待显示参数，但仍写入默认换行，使done从新行开始。若输出格式要求末尾没有空格，应采用合适的连接或首尾分隔策略，不能以屏幕上不显眼就断言没有空格。\n\nend只影响字符如何追加，不会让循环少执行一轮，不会改变value，也不改变range的端点。比较两个版本时，可先核对数字序列，再单独检查空格、分隔符和行尾。\n\n`end=''`可以不追加任何结束文本；`end='\\n'`显式指定默认换行。end与sep通常使用字符串，也允许传入None以采用默认值；不能用end=0表示“不换行”。在终端中没有换行的文字是否立刻可见，还涉及输出缓冲和flush等环境行为；不应把稍后才显示误认为计算没有执行。\n\n这组例子从教材的print与循环内外输出发展而来，参数细节按官方print说明补充。想获得精确输出时，把最终字符流写出来，比只统计调用了多少次print更可靠。"]},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-step1#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B(Python%203.0%2B)~2","parent":"py3-source/python3-step1","order":10,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例(Python 3.0+)","titleDisplay":"实例(Python 3.0+)","titlePath":["Python3 编程第一步","实例(Python 3.0+)"],"titleOccurrence":2,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-step1.html","sourceSha256":"a9c0927e9fd364ca359d597ee063502dd81c20c59964eff7578a2d7ab5573b65","articleSourceOrder":20,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.1cc250183e4896bab6d2dfba","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"}],"examples":[{"id":"py3.section.8bbca663cec248ca6b85110c.example","lessonId":"py3.section.8bbca663cec248ca6b85110c","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"先 print('A',end='-') 再 print('B')，最终一行是什么？","result":"A-B，第二次打印补上换行。"}],"activities":[{"id":"py3.section.8bbca663cec248ca6b85110c.check","lessonId":"py3.section.8bbca663cec248ca6b85110c","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.8bbca663cec248ca6b85110c.example","prompt":"先 print('A',end='-') 再 print('B')，最终一行是什么？","reveal":"A-B，第二次打印补上换行。"}],"references":[],"editorialRef":{"id":"editorial.python.runoob3","version":"1.3.0"}}
